0..78 Comment "// The simply typed lambda calculus is a theory. This source is the first rung"
79..124 Comment "// of normalisation by evaluation as a model."
125..127 Comment "//"
128..203 Comment "// Context and type indices classify its terms. Its syntax is a first-order"
204..230 Comment "// model of the signature."
231..233 Comment "//"
234..313 Comment "// Object types, contexts, variables and terms are indexed families. A renaming"
314..360 Comment "// maps variables from one context to another."
361..439 Comment "// The semantic type of an arrow is a Kripke function space. A recursion reads"
440..515 Comment "// the semantic type from the object type. The pathological twin names four"
516..533 Comment "// refused steps."
534..536 Comment "//"
537..552 Comment "// - see: #5032"
